      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1	Introductory workshop on SDG Budgeting and Green Budgeting for representatives and experts from relevant ministries and government agencies conducted.

Within the framework of the joint initiative of UNDP and the French Development Agency (AFD) on strengthening the national capacities towards introduction of SDG budgeting and green budgeting methodologies and practices in Uzbekistan a two-day Introductory workshop on SDG/Green Budgeting has been organized during 14-15 April 2022 for more than 30 (20 male and 10 female) specialists from the Ministry of Finance and line ministries engaged in the implementation of reforms in this area. 

