1.2	Study tour to the Ministry of Finance of the Republic of France to learn good international practices on Green Budgeting have been conducted for a group of experts from relevant ministries and government agencies.
A Study visit to France to learn good international practices on Green Budgeting have been conducted during 16-20 December 2022 for a group of Senior Officials (13 participants including 9 male and 4 female) from relevant ministries and government agencies including the President&#x2019;s Administration, Ministry of Finance, Ministry of Economic Development and Poverty Reduction, State Committee for Ecology and Environment Protection. 

