1.3	Methodology on introduction of SDG Budgeting and Green Budgeting practices in Uzbekistan developed by a team of international and local experts.
Considering the decision of the Government of Uzbekistan (Ministry of Finance) to apply a gradual and phased approach towards introduction of green budgeting practices in Uzbekistan, a team of international and local experts have developed a climate budget tagging methodology focusing on the alignment of budget expenditures with the climate change mitigation and adaptation, etc.
In addition, several research activities have been conducted to assess the integration of climate change aspects and considerations into the public finance management system and budgetary process in Uzbekistan. Specifically, e team of international and local experts have developed a Climate Change Budget Integration Index (CCBII) Assessment report as well as Climate Public Expenditure and Institutional Review (CPEIR) reports for Uzbekistan.</narrative>
